    "AirPods disconnected. Put them back in and tap Resume.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AirPods frånkopplade. Sätt i dem igen och tryck på Fortsätt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AirPods hear your own voice best, but answers play in call quality. iPhone hears other people better and keeps music quality in the AirPods; put it on the table.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AirPods hör din egen röst bäst, men svaren spelas i samtalskvalitet. iPhone hör andra bättre och behåller musikkvalitet i AirPods; lägg den på bordet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Alla": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
